VALUES ('ARCH-001-saudi-arabia', 'ARCH-001', 'Saudi Arabia', 'Very High', 40000, 107000, 'SAR 152k-400k/year', 'Tax-free', 'Work visa; requires authenticated degree (CHED + DFA + Saudi consulate), PRC license, medical certificate from Saudi-accredited hospital', FALSE, 'Saudi Council of Engineers (SCE) registration; NEOM and Vision 2030 projects accept international credentials', 'None; SCE registration only', 'English sufficient; Arabic a plus', 7, 'Saudi Council of Engineers (SCE); NEOM Careers platform', ARRAY['Mega-project design (NEOM', 'Red Sea Project', 'ROSHN)', 'master planning', 'BIM', 'sustainable architecture', 'urban design'], 'NEOM alone offers SAR 200k-400k/yr for experienced architects. Riyadh Vision 2030 driving massive construction pipeline. PIEP (Philippine Institute of Environmental Planners) has Saudi and Qatar chapters indicating significant Filipino professional community. Packages typically include accommodation, transportation, and annual flight home.', 'NEOM jobs are competitive globally; 5+ years experience for NEOM-level roles', 'Bespoke Careers Riyadh 2026; NEOM Careers 2025; erieri.com')
