VALUES ('ARCH-003-remote-global-freelance', 'ARCH-003', 'Remote / Global Freelance', 'High', 15000, 60000, 'USD (paid via PayPal, Wise, Payoneer)', 'Self-employed / Tax-exempt below threshold', 'No visa needed; work from Philippines; income from global clients', FALSE, 'Portfolio on ArtStation / Behance; client reviews on Upwork / Fiverr', NULL, 'English (written client communication)', 1, 'Upwork, Fiverr, 99designs, ArtStation Marketplace, Behance', ARRAY['Digital illustration', 'character design', 'book cover art', 'game asset design', 'graphic design', 'branding', 'concept art'], 'Filipino artists consistently rank among top earners on Fiverr for illustration and digital art. Beginners earn $5-15/hr; experienced artists $30-50/hr; experts $50+/hr. Upwork better for long-term client relationships (sliding fee: 20% ? 10% ? 5%). Fiverr better for short gigs. Estimated annual income: beginner USD 10k-20k, established artist USD 30k-60k+. No immigration requirement — strongest immediate pathway.', 'Platform saturation is real; strong portfolio and niche specialization required to stand out', 'trabahongonline.com 2026; Fiverr 2025')
