VALUES ('ARCH-003-canada', 'ARCH-003', 'Canada', 'High', 36000, 95000, 'CAD 48k-110k/year', 'Taxable', 'Express Entry; Provincial Nominee Programs; LMIA-based work permit; Global Talent Stream (Tech workers including game/animation); EIAP (Entertainment Industry Assistance Program in BC/Ontario)', TRUE, 'Portfolio; employer sponsorship from Canadian animation studio', NULL, 'IELTS 6.0+ for PR; studio jobs mainly English', 12, 'Canada Global Talent Stream; BC Film + Creative Industries; Ontario Creates', ARRAY['2D/3D animation (film', 'TV', 'streaming — Netflix/Disney/Amazon Canada)', 'video game art', 'VFX', 'concept art'], 'Canada has a robust animation sector driven by tax credits: Vancouver (VFX/animation hub), Montreal, Toronto. Studios hiring include Ubisoft Montreal, Electronic Arts, Behaviour Interactive, Bardel Entertainment, WildBrain. Average animator salary CAD 50k-95k. Global Talent Stream allows 2-week work permit processing for in-demand tech/creative roles. Filipino animators from studios like Synergy88, Fil-Cartoons, Toon City have track records transferring to Canadian studios.', NULL, 'glassdoor.com Canada 2025; leverageedu.com 2024')
