VALUES ('ARCH-003-singapore', 'ARCH-003', 'Singapore', 'Moderate', 22000, 84000, 'SGD 30k-110k/year', 'Taxable', 'Employment Pass (S$5,600/month minimum salary for EP in 2026); S Pass for lower-salary roles', NULL, 'Portfolio; employer sponsorship; Employment Pass via COMPASS framework (40 points required)', NULL, 'English', 10, 'Singapore Employment Pass (EP); IMDA (Infocomm Media Development Authority) — games/animation sector support', ARRAY['Game art (Ubisoft Singapore', 'Garena', 'Sea Group)', 'animation for media/advertising', 'UX/UI illustration', 'digital content creation'], 'Singapore is SE Asia''s animation and gaming hub. Average animator salary SGD 28k-94k. 2D animators can earn SGD 65k-114k. IMDA supports Singapore''s games industry — Filipino game artists relatively welcome given English proficiency and ASEAN proximity. EP minimum salary SGD 5,600/month (2026) means must secure mid-level+ role. Key employers: Ubisoft Singapore, Bandai Namco, Sea Group, Garena, Mighty Bear Games.', 'EP salary threshold rising to SGD 6,000 in 2027; ensure salary meets threshold', 'Singapore MOM 2025-2026; PayScale Singapore; salaryexpert.com')
