VALUES ('ARCH-004-uae', 'ARCH-004', 'UAE', 'Very High', 23000, 52000, 'AED 84k-192k/year', 'Tax-free', 'Employment visa (employer-sponsored, 4-8 weeks processing); MOHRE-approved contract', FALSE, 'No UAE-specific interior design license required; IDLE from PRC accepted; employer directly sponsors', 'None required', 'English sufficient', 5, 'Dubai Design District (d3) — industry hub; Bespoke Careers Gulf recruitment', ARRAY['Luxury residential', 'hospitality (hotels/resorts)', 'commercial fit-out', 'F&B interiors', 'retail design', 'show apartments'], 'Dubai and Abu Dhabi have active construction and fit-out markets year-round. Average salary AED 84k-192k/year (Bespoke Careers 2026). Tax-free + housing + transport + annual flights typical. Dubai Design District (d3) is the hub for interior design firms. Strong demand for Filipinos due to language skills and design training. Senior/project lead roles can earn AED 250k+ with experience.', 'Junior positions competitive; 2+ years PH or portfolio experience recommended', 'Bespoke Careers Dubai 2026; rfsonshr.com 2025')
