VALUES ('ARCH-004-saudi-arabia', 'ARCH-004', 'Saudi Arabia', 'Very High', 24000, 76000, 'SAR 90k-283k/year', 'Tax-free', 'Work visa; authenticated degree + IDLE certificate + Saudi Embassy attestation; medical certificate', FALSE, 'No Saudi licensing exam for interior designers; Saudi Council of Engineers for senior roles recommended', 'None required', 'English sufficient; Arabic advantageous', 7, 'NEOM interior design roles; Vision 2030 hospitality fit-out projects; Bespoke Careers Riyadh 2026', ARRAY['Luxury hospitality (Red Sea Project', 'NEOM)', 'residential fit-out', 'commercial interiors', 'retail design', 'healthcare interiors for new hospital projects'], 'Saudi Vision 2030 driving massive fit-out demand: new hotels, resorts, mixed-use developments. Riyadh average interior designer salary SAR 90k-183k; mid-level SAR 142k-191k. NEOM and Red Sea Project specifically recruit luxury interior designers. Packages include accommodation and transportation. Glassdoor data for Riyadh shows interior designers earning USD 24k-51k base.', NULL, 'Bespoke Careers Riyadh 2026; worldsalaries.com Saudi Arabia 2025; glassdoor.com 2025')
