VALUES ('ARCH-004-australia', 'ARCH-004', 'Australia', 'Moderate-High', 42000, 67000, 'AUD 65k-102k/year', 'Taxable', 'Skilled Nominated (190), Skilled Work Regional (491), Employer Nomination (186); VETASSESS skills assessment required (ANZSCO 232511)', TRUE, 'VETASSESS skills assessment (AQF Diploma level equivalent, 1 year post-qualification experience min); professional membership optional (Design Institute of Australia)', 'None; VETASSESS assessment only', 'IELTS 6.0+', 16, 'VETASSESS Assessment; Design Institute of Australia (DIA) membership', ARRAY['Residential design', 'hospitality and commercial fit-out', 'retail design', 'healthcare environments', 'aged care design'], 'Average interior designer salary AUD 88k-93k nationally. Sydney averages AUD 73k-105k. VETASSESS requires AQF Diploma equivalent (Filipino 4-year degree qualifies) + 1 year post-qualification experience. PR pathway strong. Sydney, Melbourne, Brisbane are main markets. Strong demand post-COVID for aged care and healthcare interior renovation.', NULL, 'deltaimmigration.com.au; VETASSESS; au.indeed.com 2025')
