VALUES ('ARCH-004-singapore', 'ARCH-004', 'Singapore', 'Moderate', 24000, 55000, 'SGD 32k-75k/year', 'Taxable', 'Employment Pass (min SGD 5,600/month, 2026); S Pass for lower salaries; COMPASS framework applies', TRUE, 'Portfolio + employer sponsorship; no specific licensing exam', NULL, 'English', 10, 'Singapore Employment Pass (COMPASS); SIDS (Singapore Interior Design Society) membership optional', ARRAY['Commercial office design', 'F&B interiors', 'hospitality', 'luxury residential', 'retail', 'co-working space design'], 'Singapore interior designer average SGD 36k-49k, senior roles SGD 75k+. Coohom reports SGD 22k-75k real pay range. Proximity to Philippines and English-speaking environment make Singapore appealing. EP minimum salary is SGD 5,600/month (2026), rising to SGD 6,000 in 2027 — must secure mid-level designer role. Key employers: Hassell, Aedas, SCDA, ID firms serving luxury condo and hotel market.', 'EP salary threshold a barrier for junior roles; ensure offer meets EP minimum', 'coohom.com Singapore 2025; sg.indeed.com 2025; Singapore MOM 2025-2026')
