VALUES ('ARCH-005-uae', 'ARCH-005', 'UAE', 'Moderate-High', 20000, 68000, 'AED 72k-250k/year', 'Tax-free', 'Employment visa (employer-sponsored); MOHRE-approved contract', FALSE, 'No UAE landscape architecture licensing exam; employer direct sponsorship; LALE credential from PRC recognized by employers', NULL, 'English sufficient', 7, 'Landscape Dubai / UAE landscape firms (AECOM, Cracknell, EDSA)', ARRAY['Resort and hospitality landscaping', 'urban green corridors', 'streetscape', 'master-planned community parks', 'waterfront promenade design'], 'UAE (Dubai, Abu Dhabi) has active landscape architecture market for luxury resorts, urban parks, and real estate developments. Average AED 72k-168k for landscape designers; senior roles AED 249k (erieri.com). Tax-free salary + housing allowances. Firms like Cracknell, AECOM, and WSP hire landscape architects for UAE and regional projects. Role often titled ''Landscape Designer'' or ''Landscape Architect'' without local licensing requirement.', NULL, 'erieri.com UAE 2025; gulfsalary.com 2025; archgee.com 2025')
