VALUES ('ARCH-005-saudi-arabia', 'ARCH-005', 'Saudi Arabia', 'Moderate-High', 34000, 108000, 'SAR 125k-406k/year', 'Tax-free', 'Work visa; authenticated LALE certificate + degree; Saudi Embassy attestation required', FALSE, 'No Saudi landscape architecture license; SCE registration for senior roles; NEOM accepts international credentials', NULL, 'English sufficient', 8, 'NEOM Landscape Team; Saudi Green Initiative (planting 10 billion trees); Red Sea Project landscaping', ARRAY['Arid/desert landscaping', 'green city corridors (NEOM The Line)', 'coastal resort landscape', 'eco-tourism site design', 'urban heat mitigation'], 'NEOM explicitly listed landscape architects as needed for green corridors and coastal areas. Saudi Green Initiative (10 billion trees target) drives massive demand. Average landscape architect salary SAR 125k-406k with entry level at SAR 129k (erieri.com 2025). Premium NEOM packages estimated SAR 180k-350k+. Glassdoor Riyadh data shows landscape architect roles in market. Rapidly expanding opportunity.', NULL, 'labeeb.ae NEOM 2025; erieri.com Saudi Arabia 2025; worldsalaries.com 2025')
