VALUES ('ARCH-005-uk', 'ARCH-005', 'UK', 'Moderate', 34000, 63000, 'GBP 28k-57k/year', 'Taxable', 'Skilled Worker visa; employer sponsorship required; 70 points immigration system', NULL, 'CMLI (Chartered Member of the Landscape Institute); LI (Landscape Institute) membership; BALI (British Association of Landscape Industries) for contractor side', 'LI Pathway to Chartership (P2C) — portfolio and assessment', 'English', 18, 'Landscape Institute (LI) Pathway to Chartership; BALI membership', ARRAY['Urban regeneration', 'green infrastructure', 'public realm design', 'planning-related landscape', 'heritage restoration'], 'UK landscape architect average GBP 37k/yr (uk.indeed.com). Chartered LI members (CMLI) earn GBP 33k-44k; senior roles GBP 44k-82k. No formal MRA with Philippines but international assessment route via LI available. Skilled Worker visa requires employer sponsorship (70-point system). London and South East main markets. UK-Canada MRA for architects (May 2025) — no equivalent for landscape architects yet.', 'Post-Brexit visa complexity; employer sponsorship required', 'uk.indeed.com 2025; Landscape Institute UK; golandscape.co.uk 2026')
