VALUES ('HLT-008-canada', 'HLT-008', 'Canada', 'High', 65000, 90000, 'CAD 80k-120k/year', 'Taxable', 'Express Entry (Federal Skilled Worker, TEER 1); Provincial Nominee Programs', NULL, 'PEBC (Pharmacy Examining Board of Canada) Qualifying Exam Parts I (MCQ) + II (OSCE)', 'PEBC Qualifying Exam Part I (MCQ, can be done abroad) + Part II OSCE (must be in Canada)', 'IELTS 6.0+ (varies by province)', 24, 'PEBC International Graduate Pathway (direct to Qualifying Exam from May 2025)', ARRAY['Clinical Pharmacy', 'Oncology Pharmacy', 'Long-term Care'], 'New 2025 PEBC rule: eligible international graduates can skip Evaluating Exam and go directly to Qualifying Exam. Starting salary CAD 80k rising to CAD 100k-120k. Provincial registration after PEBC (e.g., OCP in Ontario). Total process 1.5-3 years. OSCE must be in Canada.', 'Community pharmacy positions stable; clinical pharmacy in hospitals most competitive.', 'PEBC 2025, CanApprove, Academically Global')
