VALUES ('HLT-008-united-kingdom', 'HLT-008', 'United Kingdom', 'High', 38000, 57000, 'GBP 30k-45k/year (NHS: GBP 35k-43k entry bands)', 'Taxable', 'Health and Care Worker Visa (5 years, ILR eligible)', NULL, 'GPhC (General Pharmaceutical Council) via OSPAP (Overseas Pharmacists Assessment Programme)', 'OSPAP (1-year MSc-level course at accredited UK university) then GPhC registration + accuracy checking', 'IELTS 7.0 overall (min 6.5 each band)', 24, 'OSPAP Programme (GPhC-approved route)', ARRAY['Clinical Pharmacy', 'Hospital Pharmacy', 'Community Pharmacy'], 'OSPAP is a 1-year full-time postgraduate course (not cheap — approx GBP 8,000-15,000 tuition). After OSPAP, undergo a 1-year pre-registration training. GPhC registration then follows. NHS pharmacist starts Band 6 (GBP 35k-43k). Pharmacist on UK shortage list.', NULL, 'GPhC 2025, Pharmacist Support UK, PharmacistEducator.com')
