VALUES ('HLT-012-united-kingdom', 'HLT-012', 'United Kingdom', 'Moderate', 38000, 55000, 'GBP 30k-44k/year (NHS Band 5-7)', 'Taxable', 'Health and Care Worker Visa (5 years)', NULL, 'HCPC (Health and Care Professions Council) registration as respiratory physiologist or physiotherapist', 'HCPC credential review; respiratory therapy may be classified under physiotherapy or critical care', 'IELTS 7.0 or OET Grade B', 15, NULL, ARRAY['Critical Care Respiratory', 'Sleep Disorders', 'Pulmonary Rehabilitation'], 'UK does not have a separate ''Respiratory Therapist'' professional register like USA/Canada. PH RTs may work as respiratory physiologists or Band 5-6 critical care practitioners. Scope of practice is narrower. Path requires careful credential mapping.', 'Credential mapping to UK system is complex; HCPC scope for RT is less defined than in North America.', 'HCPC 2025, NHS Careers, RT Without Borders')
