VALUES ('HLT-013-australia', 'HLT-013', 'Australia', 'High', 37000, 62000, 'AUD 50k-98k/year (avg AUD 93k national)', 'Taxable', 'Skilled Nominated (190) or Employer Sponsored (482); SLP on MLTSSL', NULL, 'SPA (Speech Pathology Australia) membership + CPSP (Certified Practising Speech Pathologist)', 'No separate exam; SPA credential review; supervised practice (Clinical Fellowship) may be required', 'IELTS 7.0 in each band or OET Grade B', 15, NULL, ARRAY['Pediatric Language', 'Dysphagia', 'ASD', 'Stuttering', 'Voice'], 'Average AUD 93,864/year nationally (~USD 60k). Sydney AUD 96,500, South Australia AUD 98,300. Strong demand in NDIS (National Disability Insurance Scheme) services. New SPA minimum wage increases from June 2026 (multi-stage adjustments). Strong PR pathway.', NULL, 'SPA Australia 2026, PayScale AU 2026, Liricare 2025')
