VALUES ('HLT-013-uae', 'HLT-013', 'UAE', 'High', 48000, 90000, 'AED 175k-304k/year (Abu Dhabi avg AED 425k)', 'Tax-free', 'Employment visa (employer-sponsored); DHA/DOH license required', FALSE, 'DataFlow PSV + DHA (Dubai) or DOH (Abu Dhabi) SLP license', 'DHA or DOH Prometric SLP/Speech Therapy Exam', 'None formally required for licensure; English essential for practice', 9, NULL, ARRAY['Pediatric Autism/ASD', 'Dysphagia', 'Early Intervention', 'School-based SLP'], 'UAE has rapidly growing SLP market driven by high autism diagnosis rates, multicultural pediatric population, and government investment in special needs education. Average AED 244,831/year (~USD 67k tax-free). Abu Dhabi avg AED 425k/year (~USD 116k) for experienced SLPs.', NULL, 'SalaryExpert UAE 2025, ERI UAE, WorldSalaries Abu Dhabi 2025')
