VALUES ('OTH-007-germany', 'OTH-007', 'Germany', 'Moderate', 38000, 70000, 'EUR 35k-65k/year', 'Taxable', 'Student visa then Job Seeker Visa (after graduation) then EU Blue Card or Skilled Worker visa', NULL, 'Anabin database degree recognition; DAAD scholarship for graduate study', 'No standardized exam for research roles; Approbation for clinical positions', 'German B1-B2 required for most positions; English sufficient in international research labs', 36, 'DAAD (Deutscher Akademischer Austauschdienst) scholarships; Helmholtz/Max Planck research institutes', ARRAY['Pharmaceutical Research', 'Biotechnology', 'Medical Device R&D'], 'Germany is home to Bayer, BASF, Merck KGaA, Boehringer Ingelheim. PhD stipends typically EUR 1,500-2,000/month. Post-PhD industry salary EUR 55k-75k. English-language MS programs available. EU Blue Card fast-tracks PR.', 'German language is a significant barrier for non-research/international lab roles.', 'DAAD 2025, BiotechnikaBiotech, GermanySalaryGuides')
