VALUES ('OTH-007-australia', 'OTH-007', 'Australia', 'Moderate', 38000, 65000, 'AUD 52k-90k/year', 'Taxable', 'Student visa then Temporary Graduate visa (subclass 485, 2-4 years) then Skilled Nominated (190)', TRUE, 'Degree evaluated by skills assessing body (VETASSESS for life scientists); AIMS for medical scientists', 'AIMS (Australian Institute of Medical Scientists) certification for medical scientist roles', 'IELTS 6.5-7.0', 24, 'RTP (Research Training Program) scholarships; CSIRO research roles', ARRAY['Genomics', 'Tropical Infectious Disease', 'Marine Biology', 'Biomedical Research'], 'Australia strong in tropical medicine, genomics, and cancer research. Graduate visa (subclass 485) gives 2-4 years post-study work. Medical scientist average AUD 85k-100k. Strong path from graduate study to PR.', NULL, 'AIMS 2025, VETASSESS, Australian Biotech Industry 2025')
