VALUES ('OTH-014-new-zealand', 'OTH-014', 'New Zealand', 'Very High', 43000, 88000, 'NZD 75k-140k/year (avg NZD 108k)', 'Taxable', 'Accredited Employer Work Visa (AEWV); or Green List pathway (long-term critical skills visa, salary threshold NZD 106,080)', NULL, 'VCNZ (Veterinary Council of New Zealand) registration; AVBC recognition or individual assessment', 'VCNZ registration exam or competency assessment (depends on degree recognition)', 'IELTS 6.5-7.0', 9, 'NZ Green List — Veterinarian (long-term shortage occupation)', ARRAY['Large Animal (dairy', 'sheep', 'cattle — NZ primary industry)', 'Mixed Practice', 'Small Animal'], 'NZ has severe vet shortage — on Immigration NZ long-term skills shortage list AND Green List. Large/mixed animal vets are critically needed (NZ agricultural economy). AEWV wage threshold removed March 2025. Green List means direct residency pathway. Starting NZD 75k; experienced NZD $100k-140k. NZVA confirms shortage is acute and long-term.', NULL, 'NZVA 2025, VetClinicJobs.com NZ 2025, ENZ.org, AVBC')
