VALUES ('OTH-014-united-kingdom', 'OTH-014', 'United Kingdom', 'High', 40000, 77000, 'GBP 32k-61k/year (locum GBP 470-600/day)', 'Taxable', 'Skilled Worker Visa (vet on shortage occupation list); Health and Care Worker Visa not applicable', NULL, 'RCVS (Royal College of Veterinary Surgeons) membership (MRCVS); overseas assessment route', 'RCVS assessment for overseas graduates; may require Professional Qualifying Examination (PQE) or supervised practice', 'IELTS 7.0', 15, 'RCVS Overseas Graduate Registration', ARRAY['Small Animal', 'Equine', 'Farm Animal', 'Exotic Pets'], 'UK vet shortage active. Mid-range salary GBP 61k. Locum vets earn GBP 470-600/day. RCVS overseas graduates can register if degree from recognized school; PH DVM may require equivalency assessment. RCVS has clear overseas registration pathway.', NULL, 'TempusVeterinaryRecruitment 2025, RCVS, TheVetService 2025')
