VALUES ('IT-002-remote-global', 'IT-002', 'Remote (Global)', 'Very High', 45000, 110000, 'USD paid internationally', 'Taxable in Philippines', 'No visa needed', NULL, 'CompTIA Security+, CEH, OSCP (Offensive Security Certified Professional — highly valued for penetration testing), portfolio of CTF wins and HackTheBox/TryHackMe profile', NULL, 'English', 6, 'Bugcrowd, HackerOne (bug bounty platforms), Toptal (cybersecurity contracts), Deel for remote employment, specific firm remote SOC contracts', ARRAY['Penetration testing/ethical hacking (OSCP is gold standard)', 'SOC analyst (Level 1/2/3)', 'Threat intelligence', 'Cloud security (AWS Security', 'Azure Sentinel)', 'GRC (Governance', 'Risk', 'Compliance)'], 'Remote cybersecurity work takes two forms: (1) Contract penetration testing and security assessments — very well paid, requires OSCP or CEH, platforms like Bugcrowd/HackerOne for bug bounties; (2) Remote SOC (Security Operations Center) analyst — 24/7 shift work for US/EU companies, entry at $25—35/hr. Filipino cybersec professionals are in demand because of English proficiency and lower rate expectations vs. US/EU counterparts. Bug bounty income varies wildly — top researchers earn $100k+/yr, but most beginners earn very little. Do not plan on bug bounty as primary income initially.', 'Entry-level SOC analyst is saturated in some markets. Specialize in cloud security, OT/ICS security, or red teaming to stand out.', 'ISC2 Cybersecurity Workforce Study 2024; HackerOne Bug Bounty Reports 2024; Bugcrowd State of Hacking 2025')
