VALUES ('IT-004-remote-global', 'IT-004', 'Remote (Global)', 'High', 24000, 90000, 'USD paid internationally', 'Taxable in Philippines', 'No visa needed', NULL, 'AWS Solutions Architect, CompTIA Network+, Google Workspace Admin, Microsoft 365 Admin; ITIL 4 for service management; cloud portfolio projects on GitHub/AWS', NULL, 'English', 4, 'Upwork, Deel, Remote.com, OnlineJobs.ph (virtual assistant to IT admin pipeline), Helpdesk/IT support roles for US/AU companies, IT-BPM GIC setups in PEZA', ARRAY['Cloud administration (AWS/Azure/GCP)', 'IT helpdesk (Tier 1/2/3 escalation)', 'Systems administration (Linux/Windows Server)', 'Network administration', 'IT project coordination'], 'IT-BPM (IT-Business Process Management) is the largest employer sector for BS IT graduates in the Philippines — Accenture, IBM, Cognizant, Infosys, Wipro, TCS all have large Manila operations hiring BS IT grads for help desk, systems administration, application support, and business analysis roles. These are technically domestic (PEZA-registered) but serve international clients and may qualify as OFW-equivalent income in terms of USD-pegged salaries. Remote work entry points: Virtual Assistant ? IT Operations, IT helpdesk Level 1 ? Level 2/3 cloud admin, ITSM analyst. AWS Systems Admin remote contracts start at $18—30/hr ($37k—$62k/year). Pure IT helpdesk remote: $12—20/hr but not differentiated enough long-term.', 'IT helpdesk/Level 1 support is heavily saturated. Specialize in cloud or security as quickly as possible. IT generalists without specialization face strong competition from India and Eastern Europe at similar rate points.', 'IBPAP IT-BPM Roadmap 2028; Upwork rate data 2024; DICT Digital Jobs Philippines program data 2025')
