VALUES ('SOC-005-australia', 'SOC-005', 'Australia', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30, NULL, '{}', 'Australia has a significant psychology shortage, particularly regional areas and in NDIS services. The 5+1 program (4-year degree + 1-year honors + 1-year internship) is the general registration pathway. International applicants often need to complete an accredited Australian master''s program to gain registration. NDIS (National Disability Insurance Scheme) has dramatically increased demand for psychologists.', NULL, NULL)
