VALUES ('SOC-005-canada', 'SOC-005', 'Canada', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 30, NULL, '{}', 'Canada''s regulated psychology titles are doctoral-level. However, psychometrist and psychological associate positions exist at master''s and bachelor''s levels. Growing demand in school psychology (BC, Ontario school board mental health programs). Best pathway: immigrate via skilled worker/Express Entry, then pursue Canadian master''s program.', NULL, NULL)
