VALUES ('SOC-006-ireland', 'SOC-006', 'Ireland', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, '{}', 'Ireland is an underrated destination for Filipino social workers. Similar language and cultural familiarity with Filipino community in Ireland. Tusla (the Child and Family Agency) has hundreds of vacancies annually. HSE community social work also has large deficit. Ireland offers EU freedom of movement after citizenship (5 years residency). Dublin is expensive but regions are manageable. Salary comparable to UK with EU advantages.', NULL, NULL)
