VALUES ('OTH-002-singapore', 'OTH-002', 'Singapore', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 8, NULL, '{}', 'Singapore is Southeast Asia''s communications hub. Global agencies (Edelman, Ogilvy, Weber Shandwick, FleishmanHillard) have large regional offices. MNCs (P&G, Unilever, Grab, Lazada) have large in-house comms teams. Filipino communications professionals are well-regarded. Corporate communications roles at financial institutions (DBS, UOB, OCBC) also exist. Remote work for Singapore employers while in Philippines is also viable pre-move.', NULL, NULL)
