VALUES ('OTH-002-united-kingdom', 'OTH-002', 'United Kingdom', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 18, NULL, '{}', 'London is home to BBC World Service, Reuters global HQ, The Economist, Financial Times, The Guardian, and scores of PR agencies. Filipino journalists who have covered international stories from PH have credibility. BBC World Service Southeast Asia coverage periodically recruits. Reuters has a Manila bureau. The global comms agency sector (WPP, Publicis, IPG) has large London presences. Graduate visa route (after UK postgrad) is the most accessible.', NULL, NULL)
