VALUES ('OTH-002-usa', 'OTH-002', 'USA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 12, NULL, '{}', 'Working remotely for US clients is the most accessible US market pathway — no visa needed. Platforms like Toptal, Contra, and direct client relationships allow Filipino communicators to earn US market rates. For on-site US employment: H-1B lottery is difficult. Major wire services (AP, Reuters, Bloomberg) with Manila bureaus offer a domestic gateway to international career track.', NULL, NULL)
