VALUES ('OTH-002-hong-kong', 'OTH-002', 'Hong Kong', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 10, NULL, '{}', 'HK remains Asia''s financial PR hub despite emigration trends. Financial communications (investor relations, financial PR) is a highly specialized niche paying premium salaries. Bloomberg, Reuters, SCMP (South China Morning Post) have HK bases. Some slowdown in market due to geopolitical factors post-2020 but remains active for financial comms specifically.', NULL, NULL)
