VALUES ('OTH-009-singapore', 'OTH-009', 'Singapore', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 24, NULL, '{}', 'Singapore is Asia''s premier arbitration hub. SIAC handled over 1,000 cases in 2023. Filipino lawyers with investment law, construction law, or energy law experience can join Singapore law firms'' arbitration practices as foreign law advisors. NUS Law is a globally ranked school with strong scholarships for Filipino applicants. ADB (Manila HQ + Singapore representation) employs Filipino lawyers. International law firms (Freshfields, Linklaters, Allen & Overy, Dentons all have Singapore offices) hire foreign-qualified lawyers.', NULL, NULL)
