VALUES ('OTH-009-uk', 'OTH-009', 'UK', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 36, NULL, '{}', 'London is the global legal capital alongside New York. The Magic Circle firms (Clifford Chance, Linklaters, Freshfields, Allen & Overy, Slaughter and May) all have Asia Pacific practices involving Philippine law. The SQE route is newer but well-established. LLM at LSE, Oxford, UCL, King''s College London are strong brand names. UK offers Skilled Worker visa for solicitors — law is specifically listed.', NULL, NULL)
