VALUES ('OTH-010-usa', 'OTH-010', 'USA', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 60, NULL, '{}', 'Washington DC is the headquarters of the World Bank, IMF, Inter-American Development Bank, and the largest USAID contracting ecosystem in the world. Philippine nationals can compete for World Bank YPP (30 spots globally per year), IMF economist program (requires strong economics/econometrics), or USAID implementing partner roles at NGOs (IREX, Chemonics, DAI, Tetra Tech). Extremely competitive. Graduate study in DC (Georgetown, George Washington, American University) creates the professional network needed.', NULL, NULL)
